#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:2
msgid "Exporting Policies with LEAPP"
msgstr "使用 LEAPP 导出策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:6
msgid ""
"This guide covers how to export and deploy trained reinforcement learning "
"policies from Isaac Lab using `LEAPP <https://nvidia-"
"isaac.github.io/leapp/>`__ (Lightweight Export Annotations for Policy "
"Pipelines). The main goal of the LEAPP export path is to package a policy "
"together with the input and output semantics needed for deployment, so "
"downstream users do not need to reimplement Isaac Lab observation "
"preprocessing, action postprocessing, or recurrent-state handling by hand."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何使用 `LEAPP <https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/>`__ （Lightweight "
"Export Annotations for Policy Pipelines，策略流水线轻量级导出标注）从 Isaac Lab "
"导出并部署已训练的强化学习策略。LEAPP 导出的主要目的，是将策略与部署所需的输入、输出语义一同打包，让下游用户无需手动重新实现 Isaac Lab "
"的观测预处理、动作后处理或循环状态处理。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:12
msgid ""
"The Isaac Lab LEAPP exporter traces the data flowing between the policy and "
"the simulation, capturing the operations applied along the way. It also "
"embeds semantic metadata for the exported policy inputs and outputs. Isaac "
"Lab can consume these exports through :class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv` for "
"deployment in simulation. You can also deploy LEAPP-exported policies "
"directly on real robots through ROS using `Isaac ROS Deploy <https://nvidia-"
"isaac-"
"ros.github.io/repositories_and_packages/isaac_ros_deploy/index.html>`__ or "
"build your own deployment orchestration by parsing the YAML."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的 LEAPP 导出器跟踪策略与仿真之间的数据流，捕获沿途执行的操作，并为导出的策略输入、输出嵌入语义元数据。Isaac Lab "
"可通过 :class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv` 加载这些导出产物，在仿真中部署。也可以通过 ROS，使用 `Isaac "
"ROS Deploy <https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/repositories_and_packages/isaac_ros_deploy/index.html>`__ "
"直接部署到真实机器人，或解析 YAML，自行组织部署流程。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:19
msgid ""
"Side-by-side UR10 reaching motions in Isaac Lab on the left and on a "
"physical robot on the right."
msgstr "UR10 到达目标的运动对比：左侧为 Isaac Lab 仿真，右侧为真实机器人。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:24
msgid ""
"A LEAPP-exported ``Isaac-Reach-UR10`` policy deployed on a physical robot."
msgstr "通过 LEAPP 导出的 ``Isaac-Reach-UR10`` 策略部署到真实机器人。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:27
msgid "Supported Workflows"
msgstr "支持的工作流"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Manager-based RL environments:** Export policies trained with ``rsl_rl``, "
"``rl_games``, ``skrl``, or ``sb3`` and run them in Isaac Lab with "
":class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv`."
msgstr ""
"**基于管理器的 RL 环境：** 导出通过 ``rsl_rl`` 、 ``rl_games`` 、 ``skrl`` 或 ``sb3`` "
"训练的策略，并使用 :class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv` 在 Isaac Lab 中运行。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Direct RL environments:** Export RSL-RL policies after adding LEAPP "
"annotations; see the :doc:`Direct workflow export guide "
"<exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp>`. These policies are not "
"supported by :class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv`."
msgstr ""
"**Direct RL 环境：** 添加 LEAPP 标注后导出 RSL-RL 策略，见 :doc:`Direct 工作流导出指南 "
"<exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp>` 。 "
":class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv` 不支持这类策略。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Physics backends:** Export with Isaac Sim PhysX, Newton MJWarp, or OV "
"PhysX, as supported by your task. Use the same backend and configuration as "
"training."
msgstr ""
"**物理后端：** 根据任务支持情况，使用 Isaac Sim PhysX、Newton MJWarp 或 OV PhysX "
"导出。后端及配置应与训练时一致。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:45
msgid ""
"For more information on LEAPP, please visit the `LEAPP documentation "
"<https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/>`__."
msgstr "LEAPP 的更多信息见 `LEAPP 文档 <https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/>`__ 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:50
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:52
msgid ""
"This export flow requires ``leapp``, Python >= 3.10, and PyTorch >= 2.6. "
"``leapp`` is a specialized optional extra (it is not part of ``--extra "
"all``)."
msgstr ""
"这一导出流程需要 ``leapp`` 、Python >= 3.10 及 PyTorch >= 2.6。 ``leapp`` "
"是专用的可选额外依赖，不包含在 ``--extra all`` 中。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:55
msgid ""
"Select extras the same way as ``isaaclab train``: add ``--extra leapp`` on "
"every ``uv run``, and add the backend extra that matches your task. "
"``--extra`` makes the integration available; ``physics=...`` selects it for "
"the task:"
msgstr ""
"额外依赖的选择方式与 ``isaaclab train`` 相同：每次 ``uv run`` 都添加 ``--extra leapp`` "
"，以及与任务匹配的后端额外依赖。 ``--extra`` 使集成可用， ``physics=...`` 为任务选择该集成："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:59
msgid "**Newton** (kitless): ``--extra leapp`` (no Isaac Sim extra)"
msgstr "**Newton** （不依赖 Kit）： ``--extra leapp`` （无需 Isaac Sim 额外依赖）"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:60
msgid ""
"**OV PhysX**: ``--extra ovphysx --extra leapp`` with ``physics=ovphysx``"
msgstr ""
"**OV PhysX** ： ``--extra ovphysx --extra leapp`` ，配合 ``physics=ovphysx``"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Isaac Sim PhysX**: ``--extra isaacsim --extra leapp`` with "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx``"
msgstr ""
"**Isaac Sim PhysX** ： ``--extra isaacsim --extra leapp`` ，配合 "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx``"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:63
msgid ""
"See :ref:`uv-run-training` and :ref:`installation-optional-extras` for the "
"full extras model used by training and play."
msgstr ""
"训练和回放使用的完整额外依赖机制，见 :ref:`uv-run-training` 及 :ref:`installation-optional-"
"extras` 。"

