#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:87
msgid "Why Export with LEAPP"
msgstr "为什么使用 LEAPP 导出"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:89
msgid ""
"Running the export command generates a self-contained export directory "
"alongside your checkpoint (or at a custom path). The directory contains:"
msgstr "运行导出命令后，会在检查点所在目录（或自定义路径）生成一个独立完整的导出目录，包含："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Exported model files** — ``.onnx`` (default) or ``.pt`` depending on the "
"chosen backend."
msgstr "**导出的模型文件** ：根据所选后端，为 ``.onnx`` （默认）或 ``.pt`` 文件。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Export metadata** — LEAPP records the semantic information and wiring "
"needed by downstream deployment runtimes, including the policy execution "
"frequency."
msgstr "**导出元数据** ：LEAPP 记录下游部署运行时所需的语义信息和连接关系，包括策略执行频率。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Initial values** — a ``.safetensors`` file for any feedback state, such as"
" recurrent hidden state or last action."
msgstr "**初始值** ： ``.safetensors`` 文件，存储循环隐藏状态或上一动作等反馈状态的初始值。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:97
msgid ""
"**A graph visualization** — a ``.png`` diagram of the pipeline (can be "
"disabled)."
msgstr "**计算图可视化** ：流水线的 ``.png`` 示意图，可选择不生成。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:99
msgid ""
"The exported artifact encapsulates the policy and all observation "
"preprocessing and action postprocessing performed in Isaac Lab, so "
"deployment frameworks do not need to replicate that logic."
msgstr "导出产物封装策略，以及 Isaac Lab 中执行的所有观测预处理和动作后处理，部署框架无需重新实现这些逻辑。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:102
msgid ""
"For a detailed description of LEAPP's generated artifacts and APIs, refer to"
" the `LEAPP documentation <https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/>`_."
msgstr ""
"LEAPP 生成产物及 API 的详细说明，见 `LEAPP 文档 <https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/>`_ "
"。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:107
msgid "Exporting a Policy"
msgstr "导出策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:111
msgid ""
"Export requires a trained checkpoint. Normally you train a policy first — "
"follow :ref:`uv-run-training` and "
":doc:`/source/concepts/reinforcement_learning` — and the export command then"
" discovers the newest matching local run automatically. To get started "
"without training, RSL-RL can pass ``--checkpoint pretrained`` to download a "
"published policy for a supported core task and backend combination "
"(availability is limited; see :ref:`pretrained-checkpoints`)."
msgstr ""
"导出需要已训练的检查点。通常先按 :ref:`uv-run-training` 和 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/reinforcement_learning` "
"训练策略，导出命令随后会自动查找本地最新的匹配运行。如果希望跳过训练直接开始，RSL-RL 可传入 ``--checkpoint "
"pretrained`` ，下载支持的核心任务与后端组合对应的已发布策略（可用范围有限，见 :ref:`pretrained-checkpoints` "
"）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:119
msgid ""
"Use ``--rl_library`` to select the RL library that produced the checkpoint. "
"The supported libraries are ``rsl_rl``, ``rl_games``, ``skrl``, and ``sb3``."
" Export runs headless by default. Use the same backend extra and "
"``physics=...`` selector that you used for training. For Isaac Sim Kit "
"launches in non-interactive shells, set the EULA variables so startup does "
"not prompt:"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--rl_library`` 选择生成检查点的 RL 库。支持 ``rsl_rl`` 、 ``rl_games`` 、 ``skrl`` 和 "
"``sb3`` 。导出默认无界面运行，请使用与训练时相同的后端额外依赖及 ``physics=...`` 选择项。在非交互式 shell 中启动 "
"Isaac Sim Kit 时，应设置 EULA 环境变量，避免启动时等待确认："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:0
