msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:164
msgid ""
"When ``--checkpoint`` is omitted, the exporter uses the selected task's "
"agent configuration to find the default checkpoint in the newest matching "
"local run. This avoids hardcoding the experiment directory or training "
"iteration in the command. Pass ``--checkpoint <PATH_TO_CHECKPOINT>`` to "
"export a specific model instead."
msgstr ""
"省略 ``--checkpoint`` "
"时，导出器根据所选任务的智能体配置，在最新的匹配本地运行中查找默认检查点，因此无需在命令中写死实验目录或训练迭代次数。要导出指定模型，请传入 "
"``--checkpoint <PATH_TO_CHECKPOINT>`` 。"

