#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:237
msgid ""
"``--checkpoint pretrained`` is supported by the RSL-RL, RL-Games, skrl, and "
"Stable-Baselines3 exporters, but a published artifact is not available for "
"every task and backend combination. If no matching artifact has been "
"published, the exporter reports that it is unavailable and exits. Train the "
"task locally and omit ``--checkpoint`` for automatic discovery, or pass an "
"explicit checkpoint path. See :ref:`pretrained-checkpoints` for checkpoint "
"availability."
msgstr ""
"RSL-RL、RL-Games、skrl 和 Stable-Baselines3 导出器都支持 ``--checkpoint pretrained`` "
"，但并非每种任务与后端组合都有已发布的产物。没有匹配产物时，导出器会提示不可用并退出。此时请在本地训练任务，再省略 ``--checkpoint`` "
"以自动查找，或显式传入检查点路径。检查点可用情况见 :ref:`pretrained-checkpoints` 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:245
msgid "How It Works (High Level)"
msgstr "工作原理概览"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:247
msgid "The export command performs the following steps:"
msgstr "导出命令执行以下步骤："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:249
msgid ""
"**Creates the environment** with ``num_envs=1`` and loads the trained "
"checkpoint."
msgstr "以 ``num_envs=1`` **创建环境** ，并加载已训练的检查点。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:250
msgid ""
"**Patches the environment** for export. This step injects annotations into "
"the environment so that tensor i/o to the pipeline are identified by LEAPP "
"during execution."
msgstr "为导出 **修改环境** 。此步骤向环境注入标注，使 LEAPP 能在执行期间识别流水线的张量输入、输出。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:252
msgid ""
"**Runs a short rollout** (controlled by ``--validation_steps``) with LEAPP "
"tracing active. During this rollout, LEAPP traces all tensor operations in "
"the pipeline and automatically builds an onnx file."
msgstr ""
"启用 LEAPP 跟踪， **运行一小段轨迹** （由 ``--validation_steps`` 控制）。期间，LEAPP "
"跟踪流水线中的所有张量操作，并自动生成 ONNX 文件。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Compiles the graph** so the exported model and deployment metadata can be "
"consumed by downstream runtimes, and optionally validates that the exported "
"model reproduces the traced outputs."
msgstr "**编译计算图** ，让下游运行时能加载导出模型及部署元数据，并可选择验证导出模型是否复现被跟踪的输出。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:259
msgid ""
"The patching is transparent to the policy; no changes to your training code "
"or environment configuration are needed."
msgstr "这些修改对策略透明，无需改变训练代码或环境配置。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:264
msgid ""
"LEAPP is designed to support a broad range of model architectures, but the "
"current implementation has a few important limitations:"
msgstr "LEAPP 的设计旨在支持广泛的模型架构，但当前实现存在一些重要限制："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:267
msgid ""
"**Dynamic control flow** is not supported when the condition depends on "
"runtime tensor values, such as tensor-dependent ``if``, ``for``, or "
"``while`` logic."
msgstr "不支持条件依赖运行时张量值的 **动态控制流** ，例如由张量决定的 ``if`` 、 ``for`` 或 ``while`` 逻辑。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:269
msgid ""
"**Critical traced operations should avoid unsupported third-party "
"libraries.** PyTorch operations are the best-supported path. NumPy "
"conversions inside the traced node can be captured when they do not cross "
"the graph boundary, but external library calls may not be traceable. This "
"export path does not currently support Warp operations."
msgstr ""
"**关键的被跟踪操作应避免使用不支持的第三方库。** PyTorch 操作的支持最完善。跟踪节点内未跨越计算图边界的 NumPy "
"转换可以被捕获，但外部库调用可能无法跟踪。当前导出流程不支持 Warp 操作。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:276
msgid "Verifying an Export"
msgstr "验证导出结果"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:278
msgid "Verify an export in the following order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序验证："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:280
msgid ""
"**Run automatic validation.** Keep ``--validation_steps`` greater than zero "
"so LEAPP can replay the traced rollout and compare the exported artifact "
"with the original policy. This catches conversion errors, unsupported "
"operations, output mismatches, and common feedback-state issues."
msgstr ""
"**运行自动验证。** 保持 ``--validation_steps`` 大于零，让 LEAPP "
"重放被跟踪的轨迹，并比较导出产物与原始策略。这能发现转换错误、不支持的操作、输出不一致及常见反馈状态问题。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Inspect the generated graph.** Open the graph PNG to confirm the expected "
"inputs, outputs, and feedback edges are present. Keep graph generation "
"enabled while developing a new export path; use "
"``--disable_graph_visualization`` only when you do not need it."
msgstr ""
"**检查生成的计算图。** 打开计算图 PNG，确认预期输入、输出和反馈边都存在。开发新的导出流程时应保留计算图生成；只有不需要时才使用 "
"``--disable_graph_visualization`` 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:289
msgid ""
"**Review the LEAPP log.** When validation fails or the artifacts look "
"unexpected, the log is the best starting point for backend errors, missing "
"metadata, and unsupported model patterns."
msgstr "**查看 LEAPP 日志。** 验证失败或产物不符合预期时，应先查日志，寻找后端错误、缺失元数据或不支持的模型模式。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:293
msgid ""
"Use the default ``onnx-dynamo`` backend unless your downstream runtime or "
"workflow requires another format. Backend support can vary by model, so if "
"one backend fails, try another backend that produces an acceptable artifact "
"format."
msgstr ""
"除非下游运行时或工作流要求其他格式，否则请使用默认的 ``onnx-dynamo`` "
"后端。后端支持情况因模型而异；某个后端失败时，可尝试能生成合适产物格式的其他后端。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:297
msgid ""
"For details on ONNX, JIT, and PT2 export formats, see the `LEAPP export "
"guide <https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/guides/export.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"ONNX、JIT 和 PT2 导出格式的详细信息，见 `LEAPP 导出指南 <https://nvidia-"
"isaac.github.io/leapp/guides/export.html>`__ 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp.rst:301
msgid ""
"To run an exported policy in Isaac Lab, see the :doc:`deployment guide "
"<deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac Lab 中运行导出策略的方法，见 :doc:`部署指南 "
"<deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp>` 。"

